        "response": {
          "bodySize": 5390,
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 5390,
            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"The Jewish Outsider Trilogy - comprising Invisible City (1991), East Endings (1993), and Jewish Item (1996) - explores Jewish identity, exile, and memory through bold, independent filmmaking. Now newly restored and acquired by the BFI, this is the first time all 3 films will be screened together. \\r\\n\\r\\nIn 1991, Mark Jay was commissioned by BFI and Channel 4 to create Invisible City, a sci-fi parable reimagining an exiled Russian cinema of the 1970s. The film tells the story of two Jewish escapees from Eastern Europe in 1938 who find themselves in the ruins of a future city where language and memory have been erased.\\r\\n\\r\\nWhile making this film at the BFI, Jay worked alongside groups of Black and Asian filmmakers who were actively exploring identity, representation, and diaspora. He noticed that similar work from within the Jewish filmmaking community was less visible, often created in isolation. This realization led him to seek out Jewish artists and filmmakers working outside the mainstream—outsiders in their own right.\\r\\n\\r\\nA loose collective was formed, and in collaboration with this group, Jay produced two further films exploring Jewish identity, both past and present: East Endings (1993) and Jewish Item (1996). These films have been screened at international festivals and community events, with Invisible City also receiving two Channel 4 broadcasts. More recently, East Endings has enjoyed a revival, selling out four director Q&A screenings last year.\\r\\n\\r\\nFollowing this renewed interest, the BFI has now acquired all three films for its Mediatheque at BFI Southbank, in association with the UK Jewish Film Festival, with plans to make them available on BFI Player. Jay is deeply honored to present The Jewish Outsider Trilogy at JW3—the first time these three films will be screened together as an interconnected body of work, contextualized within the heart of the community in a vibrant, inclusive space that celebrates Jewish history and values. | The screening on SUN 6 APRIL at 5pm will be followed by a Q&A with Director Mark Jay and Dr Julia Wagner |\",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 103,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/b94769d1-b95d-4050-8c5c-6feabeafffe6.jpg\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"The Jewish Outsider Trilogy\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"6 April-10 April\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/b94769d1-b95d-4050-8c5c-6feabeafffe6-thumbnail.jpg\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"501001AQSCSPLTTNLCQDRQNSLNLPHVNRQ\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2025-04-06T17:00:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2025-04-10T14:30:00\",\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"Mark Jay\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"3407AVKPCVQSLVLLJHSHRNQMDJSNQJQVL\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"148802AKTKTJGVTJVDRDBTJLHNRDTSPJP\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n        \"id\": \"501001AQSCSPLTTNLCQDRQNSLNLPHVNRQ\"\n      },\n      \"start\": \"2025-04-09T14:00:00\",\n      \"startUtc\": \"2025-04-09T13:00:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWeb\": \"2025-03-25T13:44:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2025-03-25T13:44:00Z\",\n      \"stopSellingAtWeb\": \"2025-04-09T14:00:00\",\n      \"stopSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2025-04-09T13:00:00Z\",\n      \"webInstanceId\": null,\n      \"cancelled\": false,\n      \"id\": \"877801AJBHBTLJMVTPNGMLVJQNRBHKTPN\",\n      \"hasBestAvailableOverlay\": false,\n      \"attribute_ASSupplementaryEvent\": false,\n      \"attribute_SLCaptioned\": false,\n      \"attribute_SLFreeText\": \"Screening begins promptly at the scheduled time\",\n      \"attribute_CallBoxOfficeToBook\": \"\",\n      \"availability\": {\n        \"name\": \"JW3 Cinema\",\n        \"available\": 48,\n        \"wheelchairAvailable\": 0,\n        \"specialAvailable\": 0,\n        \"capacity\": 62,\n        \"inBasket\": 0,\n        \"unavailable\": 14,\n        \"lockInfoAvailable\": null,\n        \"lockInfoSpecialAvailable\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"3407AVKPCVQSLVLLJHSHRNQMDJSNQJQVL\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"148802AKTKTJGVTJVDRDBTJLHNRDTSPJP\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n        \"id\": \"501001AQSCSPLTTNLCQDRQNSLNLPHVNRQ\"\n      },\n      \"start\": \"2025-04-10T14:30:00\",\n      \"startUtc\": \"2025-04-10T13:30:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWeb\": \"2025-03-25T13:44:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2025-03-25T13:44:00Z\",\n      \"stopSellingAtWeb\": \"2025-04-10T14:30:00\",\n      \"stopSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2025-04-10T13:30:00Z\",\n      \"webInstanceId\": null,\n      \"cancelled\": false,\n      \"id\": \"878001AVPRRQDLQVBGPMCTPKJTDBRVHCS\",\n      \"hasBestAvailableOverlay\": false,\n      \"attribute_ASSupplementaryEvent\": false,\n      \"attribute_SLCaptioned\": false,\n      \"attribute_SLFreeText\": \"Screening begins promptly at the scheduled time\",\n      \"attribute_CallBoxOfficeToBook\": \"\",\n      \"availability\": {\n        \"name\": \"JW3 Cinema\",\n        \"available\": 55,\n        \"wheelchairAvailable\": 0,\n        \"specialAvailable\": 0,\n        \"capacity\": 62,\n        \"inBasket\": 0,\n        \"unavailable\": 7,\n        \"lockInfoAvailable\": null,\n        \"lockInfoSpecialAvailable\": null\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"
