            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"The incredible, untold true story of how a group of prisoners attempt a seemingly impossible escape from the first Nazi death camp in order to provide the first eyewitness account of the Holocaust. \\r\\n\\r\\n| Rating: 15, Duration: 1h 49m\\r\\n| All films will be preceded by 10-20 minutes of advertisements and trailers.\",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 109,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/c0a11310-57dc-4c7c-b5b2-5768706d9b96.jpg\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"The World Will Tremble\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"15 April-28 April\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/c0a11310-57dc-4c7c-b5b2-5768706d9b96-thumbnail.jpg\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"499401APGNHRMRMDGVSPSQMKVTLGNCLNR\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2025-04-15T19:00:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2025-04-28T16:20:00\",\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"3407AVKPCVQSLVLLJHSHRNQMDJSNQJQVL\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"149401ALSPNQKBLRBDJBKVKJLTNBBJLMB\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n        \"id\": \"499401APGNHRMRMDGVSPSQMKVTLGNCLNR\"\n      },\n      \"start\": \"2025-04-15T19:00:00\",\n      \"startUtc\": \"2025-04-15T18:00:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWeb\": \"2025-03-19T09:49:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2025-03-19T09:49:00Z\",\n      \"stopSellingAtWeb\": \"2025-04-15T19:00:00\",\n      \"stopSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2025-04-15T18:00:00Z\",\n      \"webInstanceId\": null,\n      \"cancelled\": false,\n      \"id\":