          "bodySize": 3840,
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 3840,
            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"After the tragic death of his father, 18-year-old Totone is thrust into the unexpected and very adult role of looking after his younger sister and their failing family farm in the Jura section of France. He assumes even more responsibility when he enters a cash competition for the best Comte cheese made in this western part of the French Alps. A \\\"verité\\\" look at the hardscrabble life of French agriculture, it is simultaneously a moving love story and above all an ode to the love of cheese. \\r\\n\\r\\n| This film is French with English subtitles. \\r\\n| Rating: TBC, Duration: 1h 32m  \\r\\n| All films will be preceded by 10-20 minutes of advertisements and trailers. \",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 92,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/433e832b-64a7-4cd2-878f-61c52bfc6aee.jpg\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"Holy Cow\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"27 April-28 April\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/433e832b-64a7-4cd2-878f-61c52bfc6aee-thumbnail.jpg\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"498602APHSMGPNVRHNLTPQSVHTTPDMPQS\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2025-04-27T19:30:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2025-04-28T14:00:00\",\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"3407AVKPCVQSLVLLJHSHRNQMDJSNQJQVL\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"149401ALSPNQKBLRBDJBKVKJLTNBBJLMB\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n        \"id\": \"498602APHSMGPNVRHNLTPQSVHTTPDMPQS\"\n      },\n      \"start\": \"2025-04-27T19:30:00\",\n  