g.uk/whats-on/wounded-land-qa\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"JW3\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/wounded-land-qa\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Wounded Land + Q&amp;A\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"As part of director Erez Tadmor&#039;s retrospective, experience the intense drama of a brutal terror attack in Haifa.\nA suicide bomber detonates a bomb, injuring himself and many victims, leading to chaos at a nearby hospital. The story follows various characters - police officers, medical staff, and victims - caught in the turmoil. Among them is Kobi Amar, a police officer torn between his duty to secure the terrorist and the growing worry for his missing son. A powerful look at family, duty, and moral conflict during a night of crisis.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/meta_facebook/public/images/Wounded%20Land.jpg?itok=GQj40Xv-\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" />\n<meta property=\"og:updated_time\" content=\"2025-04-02T17:32:28+01:00\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@JW3London\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Wounded Land + Q&amp;A | JW3\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/wounded-land-qa\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/meta_twitter/public/images/Wounded%20Land.jpg?itok=L5MUESl7\" />\n<meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Drupal 9 (https://www.drupal.org)\" />\n<meta name=\"MobileOptimized\" content=\"width\" />\n<meta name=\"HandheldFriendly\" content=\"true\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<link rel=\"shortcu