        "response": {
          "bodySize": 168658,
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=UTF-8",
            "size": 168658,
            "text": "\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" prefix=\"content: http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/  dc: http://purl.org/dc/terms/  foaf: http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/  og: http://ogp.me/ns#  rdfs: http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#  schema: http://schema.org/  sioc: http://rdfs.org/sioc/ns#  sioct: http://rdfs.org/sioc/types#  skos: http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#  xsd: http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema# \">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/kugel-qa\" />\n<link rel=\"shortlink\" href=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/node/4433\" />\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Drupal 8 (https://www.drupal.org)\" />\n<link rel=\"image_src\" href=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/banner_image/public/images/Kugel.jpg?itok=L42E4MXj\" />\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"The series explores the lives of Noacham Shtisel, a diamond dealer and the estranged brother of Shulem Shtisel, and his daughter Libbi, as they grapple with the departure of the family matriarch.\nWhile Noacham seeks forgiveness for his ex-wife in the hope that she will return, Libbi refuses to make room for her mother in her life. At the same time, Libbi harbors a secret dream that could jeopardize her chances of finding a suitable match.\nWe will be screening the first two episodes of Kugel, followed by a Q&amp;A with star Sasson Gabai. \" />\n<meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/kugel-qa\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"JW3\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/kugel-qa\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Kugel + Q&amp;A\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The series explores the lives of Noacham Shtisel, a diamond dealer and the estranged brother of Shulem Shtisel, and his daughter Libbi, as they grapple with the departure of the family matriarch.\nWhile Noacham seeks forgiveness for his ex-wife in the hope that she will return, Libbi refuses to make room for her mother in her life. At the same time, Libbi harbors a secret dream that could jeopardize her chances of finding a suitable match.\nWe will be screening the first two episodes of Kugel, followed by a Q&amp;A with star Sasson Gabai. \" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/meta_facebook/public/images/Kugel.jpg?itok=4MrnTKi3\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" />\n<meta property=\"og:updated_time\" content=\"2025-04-02T17:32:28+01:00\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@JW3London\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Kugel + Q&amp;A | JW3\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/kugel-qa\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/meta_twitter/public/images/Kugel.jpg?itok=W97HhEK4\" />\n<meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Drupal 9 (https://www.drupal.org)\" />\n<meta name=\"MobileOptimized\" content=\"width\" />\n<meta name=\"HandheldFriendly\" content=\"true\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/themes/pippip/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/vnd.microsoft.icon\" />\n<link rel=\"revision\" href=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/kugel-qa\" />\n<script src=\"/sites/default/files/google_tag/jw3_gtm/google_tag.script.js?sudvy7\" defer></script>\n\n    <title>Kugel + Q&amp;A | JW3</title>\n    <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"144x144\" href=\"/themes/pippip/apple-touch-icon.png\">\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"/themes/pippip/favicon-32x32.png\">\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"16x16