ps://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/return-other-planet\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"JW3\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/return-other-planet\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"The Return From the Other Planet\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"This documentary explores the life of Ka-Tzetnik, the mysterious writer who captivated millions with his haunting depiction of Auschwitz, famously calling it &quot;The Other Planet.&quot;\nHowever, when an experimental LSD treatment leads him to new insights, his revolutionary message is tragically overlooked. A powerful exploration of trauma, revelation, and the complexities of Ka-Tzetnik’s legacy.\nWinner of Best Documentary at the Jerusalem Film Festival. \nThis screening will be preceded by the short film, Holding On. \" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/meta_facebook/public/images/The%20Return%20from%20the%20Other%20Planet.jpg?itok=Fib4HrsM\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" />\n<meta property=\"og:updated_time\" content=\"2025-04-02T17:32:28+01:00\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@JW3London\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"The Return From the Other Planet  | JW3\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/return-other-planet\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/meta_twitter/public/images/The%20Return%20from%20the%20Other%20Planet.jpg?itok=j-r3Ch3v\" />\n<meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Drupal 9 (https://www.drupal.org)\" />\n<meta name=\"MobileOptimized\" content=\"width\" />\n<meta name=\"HandheldFriendly\" content=\"true\" />\n<meta name